"TIE Text Processing Tool\n"\n\n"This is a TIE script for text manipulation and string processing."\n\n"Function to process text: replace, split, or pattern match"\n"Define a process for handling text"\n@process process_text\n    "Input: the text to process"\n    arg text = \""\n\n    "Example: replace all occurrences of 'old' with 'new'"\n    if text == \"" then\n        text = \"Hello old world"\n    endif\n\n    "Perform a replacement"\n    replace_all text \"old\" \"new\"\n    print text\n\n    "Split the text into words"\n    split words text by \" \"\n    \"Print each word\"\n    for word in words do\n        print word\n    endfor\n\nendprocess\n\n"Execute the process with default text"\ncall process_text \"Hello old world, this is an old example\"\n\n"End of script"
